{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_07",
  "title": "11:08P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "815cb6b20dabb1ee41e016c56905ac4c8d814d4ba68b2145ba3180bcaf3096bc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "首领，企鹅物流有动作了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "......意料之内，只是给她留下了点皮肉伤......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "但我更在意的是，卡彭呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "其、其实在一个小时前就彻底联系不上了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "......最后一次例行联络是在哪里？贫民窟吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "啊，是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "那还真是可惜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "您的意思是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "先通知所有小队，按原计划拦截企鹅物流——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "但我猜，不出意外的话，大概会有那么两三个小队挂断联络吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "您这是什么意思......啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "难道——卡彭先生背叛了家族？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "我理解他，太理解他了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "我们从小一起长大，亲手为父亲解决叛徒，那是我第一次杀人，是我们第一次杀人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "叙拉古的惨败改变了我们。唯一的区别是，他变得更加懦弱，而我选择了更明确的道路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "他打算出卖家族，或者说，给家族换个姓氏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "那我们应该如何是好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "......企鹅物流比想象中棘手，我们也不能同时树敌太多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "也许，我们应该先解决叛徒的问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "text": "这里是三道口，没有异常。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "明白了，那么一切照常行动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "text": "——等、等等！我们的计划是什么来着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "啊？你小子没搞错吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "text": "呃，我只是确认一下，对龙门不太熟悉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "安魂节的午夜过后，龙门会按例举办狂欢活动，我们的任务就是趁着万人空巷时候解决企鹅物流，就这么简单！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "text": "那关于首领的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "别问那么多，这是要求，照做就是了！快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "......就是这样了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "不会杀我的，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "当然，多谢小哥啦，小睡一会吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "德克萨斯，听得见吗~？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "和这里的情况一样。他们打散了小队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "但既然首领亲自参与了战斗，他们一定有另一个指挥塔负责调度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "找到那里，一了百了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "喂~？德克萨斯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "我们已经到市中心啦，但是人真的很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "注意敌方小队的动向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "知道啦~会拜托街上的熟人们留意的......等等，老板？你要到花车上面去看看？欸，等等我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......可颂，拜松，听得见吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "你说的那个指挥塔，我们稍微有点意外发现。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "......拜松，压低身子，躲到那边的箱子后面，不要被发现。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "好，德克萨斯，一会联系。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "text": "我们，以后会怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "不知道，从我们挂断首领......挂断甘比诺·里奇的通讯开始，我们就没得选了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "叹什么气，卡彭先生在龙门为我们准备了这么多，结果呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "甘比诺从叙拉古转移过来就开始胡搅蛮缠，没一件好事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "本来按照卡彭先生的计划，根本不需要这么大费周章。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "都和鼠王聊好了，为什么非要大开杀戒？这里可不是叙拉古！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "text": "唉，首领，我是说前首领，可能只是在泄愤吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "呸，幼稚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "（他们好像起了点内讧？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（似乎是，这是大好的机会，我们——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮A",
      "text": "——！谁在那里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "欸？哪儿来的枪声？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "又是那个狙击手——！他暴露了我们的位置！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮B",
      "text": "是企鹅物流的人，别放走他们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "......少爷，对不住。这是老爷交代的工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "唉，但我竟然对少爷动了手，还让少爷陷入了危险......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "等事情结束之后，不如告老还乡吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "唉，唉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......他们好像遇到麻烦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "能天使，确认完黑帮的路线之后去和可颂汇合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "明白~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "空。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "诶......今天可疑人物的动向非常复杂，不过他们好像分成两队行动了，可能是陷阱——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "text": "没有那么复杂。敌人内部出现了问题。这是机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "哇！吓了我一跳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......你也回来了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "为什么要黑进自己人的频道，就不能正常通讯吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "text": "这样比较快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "那你现在在哪儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "text": "伤心咖啡馆。我突然想起来今天应该放假，所以来凑个热闹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊斯",
      "text": "可颂和那个新人的坐标已经发送给你们了，龙门城际网络的速度真是令人舒心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......既然如此，解决完各自的任务，就去支援他们吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "这是反击的好机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "卡彭先生，首领突袭企鹅物流的计划似乎失败了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "废话，那个莽夫能成什么事，不用管他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "......这样真的好吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "家族需要的是一个立足之地，至于姓甚名谁，根本无关紧要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "还没找到鼠王吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "没有，鼠王实在是太不留痕迹了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "有点耐心，他就像是这座城市的一部分，像是龙门的影子，虽然我们的时间已经不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "可要是不够谨慎而被鼠王察觉到的话，我们会同时面临三方的压力......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "对谁来说都是如此，如果处于劣势，我宁可让场面变得更混乱些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "有甘比诺的消息吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "为什么不说话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "真是见外，有什么事情直接联络我不就好了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "......你是怎么进来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "不是每个人都能像你一样，毫无愧疚地违背在父亲墓前立下的誓言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "誓言？那仅仅是因为我们走在同一条道路上，但是今非昔比了，甘比诺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "现在是我说了算，你让我很失望，但我愿意给你一个机会解释，老兄弟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "哼。七年前，前首领遇刺身亡，那时我就被你派到了龙门。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "我千里迢迢赶来，为的是建立一条史无前例的商业桥梁，作为家族的后盾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "但结果，你在叙拉古还是失败了，而且逃了过来，转眼就接手了我辛苦运作的一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "省省吧，你不是会为了这点蝇头小利就动怒的人，否则你早就死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "随你怎么说，我只是到了今天才发现，家族最勇猛的獠牙才是真正妨害家族的罪魁祸首。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "所以你想掰断自己的爪牙，再给自己戴上项圈？哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "继续让你在龙门肆意妄为，我们迟早会被那些不可阻挡的大势泯灭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "原来如此，我都感动得要哭了。想不到你为了家族竟然如此深思熟虑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "彼此彼此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "你身手变得迟钝了，卡彭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "你在叙拉古留下的伤也不好受，甘比诺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "放弃吧，我不想杀你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "不，你想得很。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "呵！你可真了解我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "什——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "哎呀？本想着破墙离开的......似乎撞到了不得了的现场？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "没关系喔，你们继续，我们换条路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑帮",
      "text": "快追！别让那两个人溜走了！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......好像不太有机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "正好，搅局者都到齐了，那就把你们——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比诺",
      "text": "这次又怎么了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "喂~我们来啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "......真巧，全都在这儿了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "唔，这架势是要最终决战了吗？是不是早了点？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "没关系，越早解决这出闹剧越好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "就按老板的意思，把他们扔进江里吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "哼，越混乱，越合我意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "看来，谁能从这里站着出去，谁就会成为今晚的赢家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
